# Ritual Pricing (Ritual Helper)

**Scope:** Ritual Favours / tribute-shop tile labels only. Do **not** couple to ground-loot pricing (`PoeNinjaPriceBook`, `ScanLootLabels`, `ReadMaps`).

## Performance contract (blocks merge)

| State | Allowed | Forbidden |
|-------|---------|-----------|
| `!Enabled` or (`!ShowPrices` && `!DiagnosePricing`) | **Zero** memory reads, HTTP, label build | Any UI walk, `TryResolve` for ritual |
| Enabled, shop **closed** | O(1) fast chain; BFS at most once per 2 s on failure | Per-tick BFS, full item reads, label rebuild |
| Enabled, shop **open** | Fast-chain recount; full item read only when `itemSignature` changes; labels at most every **120 ms** | Per-frame BFS, sync HTTP |

Price fetch: `RitualPriceBook.RefreshIfDue()` only — never block the main tick on network.

## Architecture

- **Reader:** `Poe2RitualRewards` — `ReadWindowState` (cheap) + `ReadRewardsFromCachedWindow` (items).
- **Tick:** `RadarApp.Tick` → `TickRitualHelper` only. Not `RefreshLootRenderFrames` / world reader.
- **Render:** `ImGuiRadarOverlay.DrawRitualLabels` — draw cached `RenderContext.RitualLabels` only.
- **Dual UI branch:** `_ritualProbeHint`; alternate branch only when primary fast chain fails (`ui-branch-probing.mdc`).
- **Zone change:** `ResetRitualSession()` clears caches and probe hint.

## Settings

`RitualHelperSettings`: `OpenReadHz` (open), `ClosedProbeHz` (closed), `PriceSource` (0=ninja, 1=scout), `config/ritual_prices.json`.

## Research

After UI patches: `POE2Radar.Research --ritual-helper` with tribute panel open.
